<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Kolosiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kolosiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolosiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na Ablusu, ata nza a bu kyangwri sa tsifa nana a bleh ata Yeso Kristi na kira Nnoh, tasa atsi ambohroh Timoti za a yama atsi leh ŋa amgbasho ba nnoh reh, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Mbohroh meh ŋa ba na amohnoh kyangwri Nnoh mboh ata ni yama nnoh ma Kolosiya, amboh ata nza ma a bu iziza ambohroh mboh ata a zizi nimeh Kristi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Ta Nnoh Ada ambohroh ta lisa nnoh alindeh tasa za ta a nga noh tuma alindeh.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwende Tasa Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Mbohroh meh kǝ kwende Nnoh na tutu, Ada ata Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi, ameh ata meh kǝ kwere Nnoh tsifa amohnoh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Mbohroh meh sehreh nga agohsoh amohnoh na Kristi Yeso tasa kira amohnoh na kyangwri Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Nza tohmoh ata a zizi, tsifa nana, ta ka a jiji a ba na amohnoh reh, ni sere nnoh tsifa gya agohsoh ata ta ka a de a ba reh. Nza a bu dehreh nga agohsoh amohnoh tasa kira a bu ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ni gya noh agohsoh reh, nza ma a lisa a gya nnoh alindeh ma inza. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Tsifa nana reh a leh a de te atoh a ba gaga tasa waka a treh atsifi ma inziyo, tswanza ta ka a bu na amohnoh reh, nza a gu anyi ameh ata ti kǝ jiji sere nnoh lisa alindeh Nnoh reh, tasa ti kǝ nza noh lisa alindeh Nnoh reh wina noh yehlehleh. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Ni sere tsifa lisa alindeh ata Nnoh reh nyi nnoh na a zizi iza atohngoh ambohroh ahwra Abafara, ŋoh nza a bu kyangwri te ndohmoh kristi ata yehlehleh reh aniye ambohroh. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ŋoh kǝ bleh reh ma ikpi kira ata huru nza nga noh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh, mbohroh meh kwere Nnoh tsifa amohnoh, nyi na ameh ata meh ti kǝ sehreh ma ikpi amohnoh reh. Mbohroh meh kwere Nnoh la ta nga noh lomo ata wina kira a ŋoh, tasa nza lomo wina ata nza anyi na huru a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Neh ni nati wina tuma noh ika ata Ada nza a kira tasa ti wina lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh ŋoh na tutu reh. Hende amohnoh a nati a mara lisa awumu alilehndeh a ba nambri, tasa ni nati te nnoh agba nimeh wina Nnoh. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Nnoh ta a nga noh wuwa agohsoh na wuwana ata nza anyi nimeh wuwana a ŋoh ata nza a bu na nga agba, la mohnoh ti wina de noh ikpi ahroh, ti soh nnoh ivoh ma yira nimeh johjoh, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />ti leh kwende Nnoh Ada na, tsifa la a bu ŋoh nza a lisa nnoh ti hunji andromboh ata Nnoh nza na a lisa a gya ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh amboh tufa yehlehleh ma akpo afiya zanana a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Nnoh reh kǝ sa reh hwana nyi na wuwana ata shini, a ka a gyuru a de reh a ba nimeh akpo afya Agohmoh amehreh a ŋoh ata ŋoh nza a kira na a ŋoh reh, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />a bu ma aki a ŋoh nza ma a sa reh a hwana reh, wohroh nza bu te kohhroh na kpakpana ambohroh mboh reh.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Kristi A keh Awumu Mboh Reh Nambri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Mbohroh meh nati wina nza Nnoh kpeh, Yeso Kristi reh a tsana reh la a bu anyi a bu Ada reh. Tasa ma tohmoh Nnoh za ata a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri, Yeso tana a yama tswanza amehreh Nnoh agbaa ata nza a de awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />A bu ma aki amehreh a ŋoh reh Nnoh a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri ma inza tasa ma inziyo, awumu amboh ata maka a nza tasa amboh ata maka a nza kpeh, a mishi amboh ata nza ma a bu na wuwana ata huru za, tasa kpra Agohmoh tasa agohgohmoh mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na wuwana bleh tsifa. Nnoh a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri ma aki a ŋoh tasa za tsifa a ŋoh. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kristi reh tana a jiji a yama feh masa a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri, tasa a bu ma aki a ŋoh za awumu mboh reh ma a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ŋoh reh a bu ikpi ata itoh a ŋoh, amboh tufa Nnoh mboh, ŋoh reh a bu chuhu fene ata itoh. Ŋoh reh a bu amehreh jitomo, ata ma ta ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, tsifa la ŋoh tsene ta bu ata jiji ŋoh nimeh awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nnoh ta ka a tsana ikpi a ŋoh nimeh kristi la ŋoh bu Nnoh reh, tana a bu na kira a ŋoh. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Ma aki amehreh a ŋoh reh, Nnoh tana a wa awumu mboh ma inziyo reh nambri a ba na a ŋoh, Nnoh reh a de tuma alindeh a ba ma aki sangra mya amehreh a ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh reh, tasa za ka a wa awumu mboh nza ma a yama ma inza tasa ma inziyo nambri a ba ma itoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />mohnoh tini bu noh gbugba na Nnoh tasa za tini kira nnoh na Nnoh kpeh, tsifa ndohmoh agugu tasa kohnoh ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Nehnehreh neh, nza a bu ma aki ata amehreh a ŋoh nza a kwo kakende reh, Nnoh a gu nnoh la ti bu noh ziza a ŋoh mboh, la mohnoh ti bu noh na zanana, ti bu noh na kpakpana kpeh, ti bu noh na andromboh ata ma a nati a kya nnoh ma ikpi kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ni nati shi wuwana nnoh atsi leh sa tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi reh kira nnoh kanga, ni nati shi nnoh na wuwana ma chuhu tsifa reh, tasa za la ti kama gbo ta nnoh gya agohsoh ata nza ni hunji noh ameh ata ti kǝ sere nnoh tsifa nana reh. A bu ma ikpi tsifa nana reh la Mya, Ablusu, meh bu kyangwri te ndohmoh a ŋoh, a bu tsifa nana ata ma ta ka ahwra a bleh ma kyangwri mboh ma inziyo nambri reh.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A te Ndohmoh Ma Kyangwri Nnoh mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Nehnehreh mya meh leh johjoh ma ikpi iya ata mya nza ni wa ma ikpi amohnoh reh, la ma ikpi iya ata mya nza ni leh wa reh, meh lisa meh ti shingi andromboh ata nza na a treh a hwa ma ikpi iya ata Kristi nza leh a wa tsifa itoh a ŋoh reh, wohroh reh a bu amboh ata nza ma a tufa ŋoh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Nnoh reh a de meh a te ahwra ma atsi te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh, a nga meh ndohmoh reh la meh ti te tsifa amohnoh. A bu ndohmoh la meh ti bleh noh tsifa Nnoh reh gaga. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Tsifa reh a bu tsifa ayuhu ata Nnoh nza a huho ma kyangwri mboh na kiri reh, nehnehreh neh Nnoh kǝ bleh kate ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />A bu na kira Nnoh reh la ŋoh ta bleh tsifa ayuhu a ŋoh reh a kate ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh, asabara ata tsifa ayuhu reh ŋoh nza a bu na wohroh ma kyangwri mboh nambri reh. Tsifa ata ayuhu reh a bu la Kristi reh a bu nimeh amohnoh. Ata areh a tsana la ni nati gafa nnoh nga agba ata Nnoh reh. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />A bu tsifa wohroh Mbohroh nza meh leh hwra tsifa Kristi bleh ma kyangwri mboh nambri reh. Na lomo ata nza meh bu na wohroh reh, meh ti kpi mboh ashotoh tasa za meh ti tsana kyangwri mboh reh nambri, na kira ambohroh la meh ti wa kyangwri mboh reh ba ma tohmoh Nnoh mata a su nimeh Kristi. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />A bu tsifa ata areh ŋa mya nza ni leh wa iya reh, tasa za mya meh leh rya tohmoh na lomo, ata ŋoh nza a leh a nga meh na wuwana a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ta meh bleh noh biroh iya agba ata mya nza ni wa ma ikpi amohnoh reh tasa ma ikpi kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama ma Lawudikiya, tasa za amboh nza ma a sohroh a wina meh kpeh. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Meh lisa dehreh la mata a hunji wuwa agohsoh, la ti bu noh anyimbehreh nimeh kira, la mata a hunji wuwa agohsoh ata mata wina a zizi awumu ayuhu ata Nnoh nza a lisa reh, ata nza a bu kristi na ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Kristi a bu anida ata nza a nati a vuru aki lomo gaga tasa wina ata Nnoh nza a bu ma huho ŋoh reh. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Meh bleh noh ata areh la akyo ta a sohroh a landa nnoh na tsifa keh na aniye kpeh, ha tsifa reh a ka nana lele. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Meh wina la meh bu na amohnoh ma itoh kpeh, mya neh meh bu na amohnoh nimeh huru, akuku meh agohsoh mya nza sehreh la ni shi wuwana nnoh nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh nimeh Kristi.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fene Afeh Nimeh Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />mohnoh nza ni sa nnoh Kristi Yeso tswanza Ada reh, rya nnoh tohmoh na hende amohnoh nimeh a ŋoh. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Ti hunji noh wuwana amohnoh nyi nnoh na Kristi, la ti lisa bu noh na wuwana gaga tswanza ariri agbeh reh, tasa ti bu noh na wuwana nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh, tswanza ma ta ka a tsana noh reh. tasa ti bu noh na kwende gaga nimeh agohsoh amohnoh. <verse eid="COL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Lisa nza noh feh, la akyo ta a de noh a te ahwra na huru tsifa wusu ata lomo kyangwri kpeh, ata nza anyi na mgba tsana akeki tufa kyangwri tasa huru mboh ata inziyo, bu ata nza anyi na Kristi kpeh. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />A bu nimeh Kristi mi, lomo Nnoh reh nambri a tuma ma itoh a ŋoh, wohroh nza a gu a te tswanza kyangwri reh. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Tasa za la ma nga noh fene reh gaga ti bu noh na a ŋoh. Ŋoh bu agba ata nza a keh mgbiri huru agohgohmoh mboh reh tasa wuwana amoh mboh.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Nimeh dohsoh ikpi na Kristi reh tama shimba nnoh kpa, bu biroh shimba kpa ikata kyangwri reh kpeh, neh ka a bu nashi mba kpa ikata Kristi nza a lisa nnoh reh, ta a tsana la ni bu noh Nnoh a ŋoh mi, ma a sa noh a hwana anyi na wuwana kpakpana ata itoh ata areh. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Na ameh ata ma ta ka a wra nnoh batisma reh, a tswanza ma nyifo nnoh ma Kristi, tasa nimeh batisma reh ma a gyuru a yiri nnoh za mohnoh ma Yeso ma aki nga agohsoh ma wuwana Nnoh, ata nza a yiri ŋoh ma kwo. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Na kiri reh tini kwo nnoh nimeh huru Nnoh tsifa kpakpana amohnoh tasa la ni wina noh Nnoh kpeh. Nehnehreh neh Nnoh kǝ a yiri nnoh ba ma fene nimeh Kristi. Nnoh a gu kpakpana amohnoh nambri a te kohhroh; <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />ta ka a firu ŋa ata kpakpana amohnoh mboh reh ata nza a dohdohsoh nnoh na akpi ata akeki ŋoh mboh reh, ta ka a fira kpakpana mboh reh nambri a kpakpa a handa a na ma gbohrohgboh reh. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Tasa ma gbohrohgboh reh a ka a sa awumu gofo amboh nza ma a de kpra mboh tasa amboh wuwana mboh ata huru reh a hwana; ta ka a nga amboh na isa ma aki ŋoh nza a keh wuwana amoh reh tasa ŋoh nza a keh mboh reh. <verse eid="COL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Ma ikpi wohroh, Kama kira nnoh akyo ta nga noh kpakpana ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ni rya nnoh ha andromboh ata nza ni wa nnoh ha ma ikpi ibi zanana ha kira nara afeh ha asabar reh. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Awumu amboh areh nambri ma a bu lulu ata awumu mboh nza ma a nati a ba ma tohmoh; a zizi yohroh tsifa reh a bu Kristi. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kama kira nnoh la akyo ta sende noh kpeh, tsifa la ŋoh a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka la ŋoh wa a bu andromboh ma atsi nza wono anyi na Nnoh, tasa ŋoh ata nza a leh a nata ma atsi kuku ikpi ata huru tsifa, tasa za maka a krumusu mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh. Kyangwri ika ata areh ka a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka wusu ma, tasa za ka a kira na ikpi a ŋoh biroh ika ata agohsoh kyangwri nza a kira reh. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Tasa a za a kohnoh tsifa tufa Kristi kpeh, ata nza a bu ikpi ata nza a de itoh. bu ŋoh mi ka a de duma amboh tufa mboh nambri, itoh a ŋoh reh, ata nza a dohsoh iba itoh mboh tasa ariri mboh a ka a te agba na agba tswanza Nnoh nza na a kira la ta a te agba reh.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Afeh Nimeh Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Tini kwo nnoh ma Kristi, ka a sa noh a hwana anyi ma ivoh huru amboh de kpra ata inziyo, bu lele ma feh ni hende noh tswanza ni bu noh ata inziyo ata areh? Bu lele feh ni tufa nnoh tufa akeki nza a bleh la, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Kama de ata areh kpeh, kama fene ata ari kpeh, kama bara mgbiri awumu mboh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Akeki tufa amboh ika wohroh ma bu akeki tufa awumu amboh ata nza ma a nati a te abibi, la ma a lisa mboh na mgba tsana ata kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />biroh akeki tufa amboh ata areh reh, ma a bu na nza iyo la a zohhoh, tswanza a de mboh mata a tufa Nnoh alindeh, ma akeki tufa ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a krembe a te reh, nza maka a nata ma ikpi ŋoh reh, maka a ha ikpi amoh nza nana la mboh ma a fa avoh amoh, tasa nga ikpi amoh iya. Neh ma a zizi akeki tufa amboh ata areh reh ma bu na wuwana shi shwa kira awumu ata inziyo areh kpeh.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />nehnehreh ma a yiri nnoh anyi ma kwo mohnoh ma Kristi, nza a bu dehreh ti gya noh agohsoh amohnoh na awumu mboh amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inza, atsi ata Kristi nza a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh na mgba ivoh rya a kpa ata Nnoh. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Gya nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh na awumu mboh nza ma a bu ma inza reh, ta kama a bu na awumu mboh nza ma a bu ma inziyo areh kpeh. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />mohnoh ni kwo nnoh, fene amohnoh a bu ma huho ŋoh na Kristi nimeh Nnoh. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Fene amohnoh ata a zizi reh a bu Kristi tasa nza ŋoh tana a gu ikpi a ŋoh a kate reh, mbohroh za meh nati gu ikpi ambohroh kate na a ŋoh meh ti gafa agba a ŋoh reh za!<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fene Atono Tasa Fene Afeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nza a bu dehreh, mohnoh ti mla nnoh kohnoh ata inziyo ata ka a de hwa amwo iyo a ba reh kwo nnoh, biroh hende leh ahohndoh, hende te abibi, hende te agugu, hwa amwo iyo, tasa kira ikpi, wohroh za a bu krumusu nnoh akǝkehreh mboh. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Tsifa awumu amboh wohroh, gofo Nnoh a nati a ba na amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira kpeh reh. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Na amehmeh reh mohnoh za tini kǝ lisa nnoh biroh tuma abibi reh za, na ameh ata awumu abibi mboh reh tama a keh wuwana amohnoh reh.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />nehnehreh neh ni nati ta lisa nnoh biroh awumu ika wohroh reh kanga: gofo, tasa vuru iyo, tasa de akyo ma agohsoh, tasa kya, tasa bleh tsifa abibi. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Kama huru nnoh tsifa ma itoh amohnoh kpeh, mohnoh tini gu nnoh kohnoh amohnoh atono reh tavoh nnoh tasa ndohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Tasa za ti gu nnoh itoh afeh were nnoh. Ata areh a bu kyangwri afeh ata nza a bu Nnoh reh, ŋoh ata nza a lisa reh, a leh a de reh a te afehfeh meh ti tswanza ŋoh reh, la ŋoh ta a de noh a ba ti wina noh la a bu ŋoh a lisa nnoh. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh, Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma za a bu tse za kpeh, akyo ata nza ma shimba kpa a ŋoh kpeh reh, ha ata nza a bu shimba ŋoh kpeh reh, kyangwri agohsoh akpangra, ha akyo ata nza anyi hohroh bini, ahwra, tasa akyo ata nza a bu ahwra kpeh, ŋoh Kristi reh a bu awumu mboh reh nambri, a bu nimeh ambohroh nambri.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nnoh reh a seh nnoh la ti bu noh kyangwri a ŋoh mboh amboh zanana, tasa za la a kira na amohnoh, nza a bu dehreh, mohnoh za ti nza noh kwini itoh amohnoh, ti kǝ lisa nnoh alindeh, kuku ikpi, lisa ve, tasa soh ivoh yira. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Kama te noh gofo na itoh amohnoh kpeh. Nza ni nza la akyo anyi a lisa nnoh andromboh abibi reh. Te noh kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh mboh kanga, tswanza Ada za nza a te kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh mboh reh. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Andromboh ata nza a keh mgbiri awumu mboh reh nambri a bu la ti kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh, a bu kira nza a lafa awumu mboh reh nambri mata a bu ma akpo anyimbehreh reh. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Ta nnoh tuma alindeh ata Kristi nza a de a ba reh ta a rya tohmoh nimeh amohnoh, a bu tsifa tuma alindeh ika wohroh ata Nnoh nza a fi noh la ti bu noh itoh anyimbehreh reh, Tasa za ti bu noh amboh kwende Nnoh. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ta nnoh tsifa Kristi reh ta tuma nimeh agohsoh amohnoh, ti tsana noh itoh amohnoh tasa za ti kpi nnoh ashotoh ma itoh amohnoh na lomo. Tasa za ti kpa nnoh amumu Zabura ata riri Nnoh, ti kpa nnoh amumu kwende Nnoh Nnoh za nimeh agohsoh amohnoh mboh. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Andromboh ata nza ni lisa noh reh ha ata nza ni bleh noh reh, ta bu lisa ŋoh nimeh sa Ada Yeso, tswanza nza ni kwende Nnoh Nnoh ma aki a ŋoh nza a bu Ada reh.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Ata Nza A zohhoh Na amboh Tufa Mboh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />mohnoh ifiya mboh, nga nnoh ikpi amohnoh ma tsitsifa amohnoh mboh, ata areh a bu andromboh ata nza a zohhoh mohnoh amboh tufa Nnoh mboh ti lisa nnoh.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />mohnoh tsifa mboh za, kira nnoh na ifiya amohnoh mboh, kama te nnoh gofo na amoh kpeh.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />mohnoh amehreh mboh, sehreh noh tsifa atsiyoh amohnoh mboh reh nambri, ata areh a bu andromboh ata nza nana agohsoh ma Nnoh reh.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />mohnoh ada mboh za, kama lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a nati nga mara amohnoh mboh gofo kpeh, la dehreh ta aniye mboh amgbasho atsi lisa andromboh alindeh kpeh. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />mohnoh ahwra mboh za, nga nnoh agba ma agbugba amohnoh mboh nza ma a yama ma inziyo areh, kama lisa nnoh alindeh tsifa la mata a nza noh kpeh, mgbiri maka a lisa alindeh la kyangwri mata a nza mboh ma, nnoh neh lisa alindeh na agohsoh anyimbehreh ti nyiri Ada. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Andromboh ata nza ni lisa noh reh, lisa nnoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh tswanza ni lisa noh ma Ada, ta a kama bu tswanza ni lisa ma kyangwri reh. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Kohnoh nza noh la Ada a nati nga nnoh tswanza firoh andromboh ata ŋoh nza a gya ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh, Tsifa la ŋoh Kristi a bu Ada ata a zizi ata mbohroh nza meh leh tufa ŋoh reh. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Akyo ata nza a lisa ndohmoh agugu reh, a nati a hunji firoh agugu a ŋoh reh anyi na Nnoh, tsifa la Nnoh a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh reh ika wohroh anyimbehreh.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Kyangwri agbugba mboh, lisa nnoh yehlehleh ma ahwra amohnoh mboh. Lisa nnoh dehreh tsifa la mohnoh za ni bu noh na Ada amohnoh ma inza.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kpi Ashotoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Nata nnoh nimeh kwere Nnoh, nza ni nati kwere nnoh Nnoh reh, lisa nza noh ti kwende Nnoh Nnoh za. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Tasa za kwere turoh Nnoh, la Nnoh ta nga reh avu ata hwra tsifa huho ata Kristi reh bleh. A bu tsifa wohroh reh nza meh bu nimeh ida ka nehnehreh reh. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Kwere meh noh Nnoh, la meh ti tsifa reh yehlehleh. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Nimeh tuma amohnoh na amboh ata nza ma a bu amboh tufa Nnoh kpeh reh, tuma noh na lomo, ti kǝ te noh ndohmoh na lomo, tasa na avu mboh ata nza ni hunji noh reh. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Tsifa amohnoh ta a bu alindeh tasa ta kpi agohsoh kyangwri mboh, tasa nza ma luhu nnoh tsifa, sa mboh tsifa reh ma aki ata nza a bu yehlehleh.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu Atsifa Ma Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Iza ambohroh Tikikus, ŋoh nza a bu atohngoh ambohroh alindeh nimeh te ndohmoh Ada, a nati a bleh ma ikpi amya nambri. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh ŋa nza meh tohmoh ŋoh ba na amohnoh reh, ta a bleh noh rya tohmoh ambohroh la ta nga noh wuwana. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Ma a nati a na mboh ma Onisimu, iza ambohroh ata nza a bu yehlehleh, nza a bu nimeh amohnoh. A nati a bleh noh awumu mboh nza a bu na ma areh. <verse eid="COL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarku, nza a bu na amya ma ida ka, a bleh la meh ti tsifa na amohnoh, tasa Markus atsini Barnaba. (Ma a bleh noh la ti sa nnoh Markus nza a nati a ba na amohnoh reh) <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yoshuwa nza maka a fi la Justus, a tohmoh meh la meh ti tsifa na amohnoh za. amboh atatoh wohroh ma a bu Yahudawa amboh tufa nza ma a te ndohmoh na amya ma ndohmoh Nnoh, mboh reh ma a shingi meh gaga.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Abafara atsifa na amohnoh, ŋoh za bu anyimbehreh nimeh amohnoh tasa ahwra Kristi Yeso. Ŋoh ka a kwere Nnoh gaga tsifa amohnoh, ka luhu Nnoh la ti shi wuwana nnoh, ika ata amboh tufa Kristi ata maa a kira ma aki tufa tsifa Nnoh nambri. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Mya na ikpi amya za meh nati bleh ma ikpi ndohmoh alindeh a ŋoh nza a lisa nnoh, tasa ma kyangwri Lawudikiya tasa Hirafolis. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka, kyangwri wra ambohroh, tasa Demas, ma atsifa na amohnoh. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Tsifa meh noh na amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Lawudikiya tasa Nimfa tasa amboh tufa nza maka a dohsohna ma afya a ŋoh. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Nza ni bleh amgbasho reh, ti bleh noh ma ida Nnoh ma Lawudikiya za. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Tasa ti bleh noh ma Arkilusu &lt;&lt; Ta a treh ndohmoh ata nza ma nga ŋoh nimeh ndohmoh Ada reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mya Ablusu meh ŋa ata areh na ivoh amya: Meh tsifa na amohnoh. Kama gu te nnoh kwo ahroh kpeh ma ta ka a de meh a tsitsiya reh! Ta lisa alindeh ata Nnoh ta a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>